{"title":"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(🚀_Just_1_min_🚀)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (🚀 Just 1 min 🚀)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_The_Learning_Royal\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by The Learning Royal</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_North_America_Math_Contest_Go_Go_Go\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_STEMbreezy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by STEMbreezy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Carrie has a rectangular garden that measures <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> feet by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> feet. She plants the entire garden with strawberry plants. Carrie is able to plant <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> strawberry plants per square foot, and she harvests an average of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> strawberries per plant. How many strawberries can she expect to harvest?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/4/ea4870a42f82b65bf3e9e7103e794c94e26bb764.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }560 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }960 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) }1120 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) }1920 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) }3840$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"470\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that the unit of the answer is <b>strawberries</b>, which is the product of\n</p>\n<ul><li>square feet</li></ul>\n<ul><li>plants per square foot</li></ul>\n<ul><li>strawberries per plant</li></ul>\n<p>By conversion factors, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dab5ccb8ae2ffbf2c5aa8712ad3d669c0537fe.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(6 \\ \\color{red}\\cancel{\\mathrm{ft}}\\color{black}\\cdot8 \\ \\color{red}\\cancel{\\mathrm{ft}}\\color{black}\\right)\\cdot\\left(4 \\ \\frac{\\color{green}\\cancel{\\mathrm{plants}}}{\\color{red}\\cancel{\\mathrm{ft}^2}}\\right)\\cdot\\left(10 \\ \\frac{\\mathrm{strawberries}}{\\color{green}\\cancel{\\mathrm{plant}}}\\right)=6\\cdot8\\cdot4\\cdot10 \\ \\mathrm{strawberries}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }1920} \\ \\mathrm{strawberries}.\\]\" width=\"729\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM ~Bobthegod78\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of the garden is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/7/267c92ccd59a6a97b91aea81e3f66ea55bfe7ec7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 \\cdot 8 = 48$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" /> square feet. Since Carrie plants <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> strawberry plants per square foot, there are a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/e/15eae7c6d5fd8e5cd2dadfa5f2867d1f1c463c05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$48 \\cdot 4=192$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"91\" height=\"13\" /> strawberry plants, each of which produces <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> strawberries on average. Accordingly, she can expect to harvest <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/2/cb214463c816556fbca450fc7b4da4b7e5b4434b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$192 \\cdot 10 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }1920}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"167\" height=\"28\" /> strawberries.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_.28Easy_to_understand.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8hgK6rESdek&amp;t=9s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8hgK6rESdek&amp;t=9s</a>\n</p><p>~NiuniuMaths\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28.F0.9F.9A.80_Just_1_min_.F0.9F.9A.80.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(🚀_Just_1_min_🚀)\">Video Solution (🚀 Just 1 min 🚀)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (🚀 Just 1 min 🚀)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/8jL971T8scM\">https://youtu.be/8jL971T8scM</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/7S0wAZMy2ZQ\">https://youtu.be/7S0wAZMy2ZQ</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_The_Learning_Royal\">Video Solution by The Learning Royal</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by The Learning Royal\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/eSxzI8P9_h8\">https://youtu.be/eSxzI8P9_h8</a>\n</p><p>~The Learning Royal\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Interstigation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/YnwkBZTv5Fw?t=92\">https://youtu.be/YnwkBZTv5Fw?t=92</a>\n</p><p>~Interstigation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_North_America_Math_Contest_Go_Go_Go\">Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_IjQnXnVKeU\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_IjQnXnVKeU</a>\n</p><p>~North America Math Contest Go Go Go\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_STEMbreezy\">Video Solution by STEMbreezy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by STEMbreezy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/L_vDc-i585o?list=PLFcinOE4FNL0TkI-_yKVEYyA_QCS9mBNS&amp;t=89\">https://youtu.be/L_vDc-i585o?list=PLFcinOE4FNL0TkI-_yKVEYyA_QCS9mBNS&amp;t=89</a>\n</p><p>~STEMbreezy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\">Video Solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheNeuralMathAca